 "premise": "Satoshi Kon's single-volume story set in a small fishing town. For generations the Yashiro family of Shinto priests has kept a pact with the merpeople: every sixty years they receive a mermaid's egg and return it to the sea, in exchange for good catches and calm seas. When Yosuke's father lets developers turn the egg into a tourist attraction for a resort, the skeptical Yosuke begins to see strange events unfold.",
 "life_message": "Keeping faith with the promises and the natural world your community depends on matters more than quick prosperity.",
